{"id":4607,"date":"2024-12-02T22:17:58","date_gmt":"2024-12-02T14:17:58","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=4607"},"modified":"2024-12-02T22:17:59","modified_gmt":"2024-12-02T14:17:59","slug":"sintered-filter-mesh-2","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/?product=sintered-filter-mesh-2","title":{"rendered":"Sintered filter mesh"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><strong>Optional fibers<\/strong>: 316L, 304L, and 304 stainless steel, Hastelloy, Inconel, Monel and Nickel, or other special materials.\u00a0<strong>Standard size<\/strong>: 500*1000mm and 1000*1200mm, also can be customizable<br \/>\n<strong>Features<\/strong>: excellent mechanical strength, Superior corrosion and abrasion resistance, etc.<\/p>\n<h3>1.Sintered multi-layered woven filter mesh composites<\/h3>\n<p>This class of filtration media is sintered under high temperature with our unique process, so that the wires are well-bonded at every point of contact to ensure excellent mechanical strength, pore stability, and accurate filtration during services. This product especially suitable for fine filtration of high temperature, high pressure and viscous fluids.<\/p>\n<h3>Features of sintered multi-layered woven filter\u00a0mesh composites:<\/h3>\n<p>Filtration resistance is extremely low due to surface filtration; Cleanable and reusable with routine cleaning methods; Lower flow resistance and significantly higher permeability; Superior corrosion and abrasion resistance.<\/p>\n<h3>Standard size of sintered multi-layered woven filter mesh composites:<\/h3>\n<p>Philite\u00ae routinely produces standard 5-layered and 6-layered woven filter mesh composites at sizes of 500*1000mm and 1000*1200mm. For other sizes, please consult with us.<\/p>\n<h3>Technical data of sintered filter mesh:<\/h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Grade<\/td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Nominal filtering rating (\u03bcm)<\/td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Absolute filtering rating (\u03bcm)<\/td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Bubble Point Pressure (Pa)<\/td>\n<td colspan=\"2\" bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">Standard Thickness(mm)<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">5-layered composite<\/td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#e5e5e5\">6-layered composite<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S-2<\/td>\n<td>2<\/td>\n<td>8~9<\/td>\n<td>5570<\/td>\n<td rowspan=\"12\">\n<p align=\"center\">1.7<\/p>\n<\/td>\n<td rowspan=\"12\">\n<p align=\"center\">3.5<\/p>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S-5<\/td>\n<td>5<\/td>\n<td>12~14<\/td>\n<td>3569<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S-10<\/td>\n<td>10<\/td>\n<td>16~18<\/td>\n<td>2938<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S-15<\/td>\n<td>15<\/td>\n<td>24~26<\/td>\n<td>2380<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S-20<\/td>\n<td>20<\/td>\n<td>28~32<\/td>\n<td>2190<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S-30<\/td>\n<td>30<\/td>\n<td>40~45<\/td>\n<td>1750<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S-40<\/td>\n<td>40<\/td>\n<td>58~63<\/td>\n<td>1050<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S-50<\/td>\n<td>50<\/td>\n<td>72~80<\/td>\n<td>920<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S-60<\/td>\n<td>60<\/td>\n<td>68~79<\/td>\n<td>780<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S-75<\/td>\n<td>75<\/td>\n<td>86~98<\/td>\n<td>720<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S-100<\/td>\n<td>100<\/td>\n<td>112~120<\/td>\n<td>650<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td>S-150<\/td>\n<td>150<\/td>\n<td>160~175<\/td>\n<td>530<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p><strong>Note:\u00a0<\/strong>standard 6-layered sintered woven filter mesh composite is produced by adding a layer of 12*12 filter mesh to standard 5-layered sintered woven filter mesh composite.<\/p>\n<h3>Applications:<\/h3>\n<p>Sintered multi-layered woven filter mesh composites have been extensively used in petrochemical, chemical, nuclear, food, pharmaceutical, airspace and environmental industries, as well as in polymer filtration, viscose filtration, water and gas filtration.<\/p>\n<h3>2. Sintered filter mesh and perforated plate laminates<\/h3>\n<p>The filter mesh and perforated plate laminates are produced by sintering multi-layer filter mesh and perforated plate together. As a result, the laminates not only can perform filtration, but also provide excellent mechanical support. This class of filtration media can be worked mechanically, deformed, or welded.<\/p>\n<h3>Standard size of Sintered filter\u00a0mesh and perforated plate laminates:<\/h3>\n<p>Philite\u00ae routinely produces sintered filter mesh and perforated plate laminates at sizes of 500*1000mm and 1000*1200mm. For other sizes, please consult with us.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Philite\u00ae mainly produce two kinds of sintered filter mesh, including Sintered multi-layered woven filter mesh composites and Sintered filter mesh and perforated plate laminates.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":4608,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"site-sidebar-layout":"default","site-content-layout":"","ast-site-content-layout":"default","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility":"","ast-main-header-display":"","ast-hfb-above-header-display":"","ast-hfb-below-header-display":"","ast-hfb-mobile-header-display":"","site-post-title":"","ast-breadcrumbs-content":"","ast-featured-img":"","footer-sml-layout":"","theme-transparent-header-meta":"default","adv-header-id-meta":"","stick-header-meta":"default","header-above-stick-meta":"","header-main-stick-meta":"","header-below-stick-meta":"","astra-migrate-meta-layouts":"set","ast-page-background-enabled":"default","ast-page-background-meta":{"desktop":{"background-color":"var(--ast-global-color-4)","background-image":"","background-repeat":"repeat","background-position":"center center","background-size":"auto","background-attachment":"scroll","background-type":"","background-media":"","overlay-type":"","overlay-color":"","overlay-opacity":"","overlay-gradient":""},"tablet":{"background-color":"","b